# WP-OUTLINER (UE 5.5 Scene Outliner in World Partition mode): a partitioned world opened from its files lists, in
# ONE tree, the loaded entities and - grey, after them - every record left on disk, read off the descriptor index
# (FActorDescTreeItem: name, type, cell; double-click loads it by pinning it). "*" marks an entity that differs from
# its file (EntityPackages::IsDirty), the Unsaved checkbox keeps only those (and their parents); the Pin gutter is
# UE's Pinned column (the pinned actors loader adapter, kept per user in Saved/Config/WorldPartitionEditor.json);
# Data Layers lists each entity's layers. A region change that would unload an unsaved entity asks
# Save / Discard / Cancel (FEditorFileUtils::SaveDirtyPackages) instead of being refused.
# The house: Main C08_08_B00 (record 200408, at X 54.6 m Z 22.6 m) - the Main building nearest the centre.
# WP_Protocol is FROZEN: the move is cancelled and undone, never saved.
# Lead: the region step clicks the World Partition map - drag from about (-100 m, -100 m) to (100 m, 100 m) around
# the world centre; read the map's points off a shot-window frame (pixels / pixelsPerPoint, minus the panel corner)
# and replace MAPX0,MAPY0 / MAPX1,MAPY1 below.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Unload All"
Дано input press "World Partition" MAPX0,MAPY0
Дано input move "World Partition" MAPX1,MAPY1
Дано input release "World Partition" MAPX1,MAPY1
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load Region (map selection)"
Дано select 200408
Дано --subject selection set Translation 6464,-1004.1875,2261
Тогда outliner_wp Outliner: строка "Main C08_08_B00" с оранжевой "*" (не сохранён); после загруженного дерева - серые строки невыгруженных сущностей с типом (Static Mesh) и ячейкой "[L0 (x, z)]"; в шапке колонки Pin (булавка) и Data Layers; над таблицей флажки Unsaved и Unloaded и "N not loaded"
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Unload All"
Тогда outliner_prompt модальный диалог "Unsaved Entities": "1 unsaved entity: Main C08_08_B00", кнопки Save / Discard / Cancel; в мире ничего не выгружено (дом на месте, сдвинут)
Когда input key - - Escape
Тогда outliner_cancel диалога нет; строка состояния World Partition: "Cancelled: nothing was loaded or unloaded."; дом по-прежнему с "*"
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Unload All"
Тогда outliner_unloaded без диалога: загружена только всегда-загруженная часть, дом - серая строка в Outliner, "*" нет ни у одной строки
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Тогда outliner_restored весь мир загружен, серых строк нет; дом на исходном месте
